---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="Privacy notice" description="How DeepTek handles personal data submitted through this website.">
  <PageHero label="Legal" title="Privacy notice." lead="Last updated: October 2026. This is a starting draft and should be reviewed by a legal adviser before launch." />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you use the contact form we receive the details you enter: your name, email address, and optionally your
        company, phone number, budget range and message. We do not use advertising cookies or third-party tracking on
        this website.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your details only to reply to your enquiry and, if you become a client, to deliver our services. We do not
        sell or share your details for marketing.
      </p>

      <h2>Services we rely on</h2>
      <p>
        The website is hosted on Cloudflare. Cloudflare Turnstile is used to protect the form from spam and may process
        technical data such as your IP address. Form submissions are delivered to us by email through a transactional
        email provider.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiries are kept for up to 24 months unless we start working together, after which client records are kept for
        as long as required by UAE law.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the UAE Personal Data Protection Law you can ask to access, correct or delete your personal data. Email
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or call <a href={`tel:${site.phone.tel}`}>{site.phone.display}</a> and we will respond promptly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 46rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .prose h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .prose p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
